Changes in this repository compared with the original:
- renamed robot, access point, hostname and boot splash (Screech)
- new "arcade" OLED face bitmap set and per-face frame rates
- retro appliance-styled web controller with Cyrillic subtitles
- animation timing defaults (frameDelay, walkCycles) and face loop modes
- home WiFi credentials moved to a git-ignored secrets.h
- flash.sh one-command build and flash script for macOS
- beginner build handbook (build.html) and a parts drawing pack (PDF)
- body parts made from paper, reinforced with wooden dowels and glue,
  using the Sesame STL shapes as reference
